  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1202.50 “Pretreatment requirement” means any substantive or procedural requirement related to pretreatment imposed on an industrial user, other than a pretreatment standard.\n\nSource. #8235, eff 12-22-04 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1200) (formerly Env-Ws 1202.50); ss by #9798-A, eff 10-9-10 (from Env-Wq 1202.49); ss by #12739, eff 3-19-19",
